    "body": "Boundary detail from a parallel verification (#262, closed as duplicate): binary inputs 4 ≤ L ≤ 16 abort at lz78y_test.h:17 (assert L > B_len), L = 17 and 18 at line 18 (assert L-B_len > 2), L = 19 runs and reports -0; L = 3 aborts at multi_mmc_test.h:21 because the len < 3 check at :158 sits after the binary dispatch at :156; repeat-free inputs of any width (2 bytes, 256 distinct bytes, {0,1,2}) abort at lrs_test.h:149. The non-binary LZ78Y path refuses len < 18 with a message saying 'need more than 18', so the two paths and the message disagree at 18.",
